    "detailed_description": "&quot;Pomberito&quot; is a first-person horror adventure game set in the folklore-rich landscapes of South America. The game unfolds over five micro-episodes, each representing a night from Monday to Friday. Taking place in the rural countryside of a northeastern province of Argentina, players step into the shoes of a local character tasked with completing daily chores in a farm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761100/extras/9a529d7eb991abddeef4da989c63facc.avif?t=1740773693\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br>As the protagonist navigates through the isolated environment, you will encounter elements inspired by South American folklore, adding a unique and cultural twist to the horror genre. The game's suspenseful ambiance intensifies as each night progresses, with unexpected twists and encounters awaiting the player.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761100/extras/403ceafbebde592c3ad37db773ea6abe.avif?t=1740773693\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br>One of the standout features of &quot;Pomberito&quot; is its multiple endings, allowing players to explore different outcomes based on their decisions and actions throughout the week. Players will strive to uncover the mysteries surrounding the folklore-inspired horrors in the rural landscapes of Argentina.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761100/extras/ddb4fb3517e0d15987be2efddd1c3878.avif?t=1740773693\" width=616 height=150 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Pomberito&quot; is a first-person horror adventure game set in the folklore-rich landscapes of South America. The game unfolds over five micro-episodes, each representing a night from Monday to Friday. Taking place in the rural countryside of a northeastern province of Argentina, players step into the shoes of a local character tasked with completing daily chores in a farm.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761100/extras/9a529d7eb991abddeef4da989c63facc.avif?t=1740773693\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br>As the protagonist navigates through the isolated environment, you will encounter elements inspired by South American folklore, adding a unique and cultural twist to the horror genre. The game's suspenseful ambiance intensifies as each night progresses, with unexpected twists and encounters awaiting the player.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761100/extras/403ceafbebde592c3ad37db773ea6abe.avif?t=1740773693\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br>One of the standout features of &quot;Pomberito&quot; is its multiple endings, allowing players to explore different outcomes based on their decisions and actions throughout the week. Players will strive to uncover the mysteries surrounding the folklore-inspired horrors in the rural landscapes of Argentina.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761100/extras/ddb4fb3517e0d15987be2efddd1c3878.avif?t=1740773693\" width=616 height=150 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Survive 5 nights in the heart of northeastern Argentina as a local farmer and reveal the truth behind the haunting tales of the Pombero in a world where folklore meets terror.",
